    // which drops `display` entirely) — carousel needs it for its own `justifyContent`/
    // `alignItems` layout, since `zimmProductCardMedia.css.ts`'s own unconditional `display: 'none'`
    // is gone. `clipPath: 'none'` is the actual reveal signal now, added alongside it.
